    "⌘↩ sends and marks done; ⌥⌘↩ sends and keeps it in the Inbox. Undo brings both back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌘↩ sender og markerer færdig; ⌥⌘↩ sender og beholder den i indbakken. Fortryd bringer begge dele tilbage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No conversation is open in Tidings.": {
